# STFSpec.Base

Primitive types and conversions: the `U256` API, fixed-width words, `Bytes`, `Address`, `Hash32`, `Bytes32`, big-endian conversions, and the `Envelope` record. No fork policy.

Library `EthBase`. Its allowed dependencies are listed in `scripts/boundaries.toml`
(see `STFSpec/informal/ARCHITECTURE.md` §3). No definitions yet: scaffolding only.
Spec guidance: `STFSpec/informal/modules/EthBase.md`.
